PROJECT STRUCTURE
-----------------

  mittleff/
  ├── src/
  │   └── mittleff/       Library source code
  ├── tests/              Unit tests
  ├── examples/           Example programs
  ├── configure.ac        Autoconf configuration
  ├── Makefile.am         Automake makefile
  └── mittleff.pc.in     pkg-config template


TROUBLESHOOTING
---------------

If 'make check' fails to find the library:
  $ export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH

If pkg-config can't find mittleff:
  $ export PKG_CONFIG_PATH=/usr/local/lib/pkgconfig:$PKG_CONFIG_PATH

On some systems, you may need to run ldconfig after installation:
  $ sudo ldconfig


MORE INFORMATION
----------------

For more information about GNU Autotools:
  $ info Automake
  $ info Autoconf
  $ info Libtool

For pkg-config documentation:
  $ man pkg-config
